      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0290-88ccccab6be3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HANCOCK COUNTY, OHIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hancock County, Ohio is where Ralph Cole was originally elected to represent and where he held various positions such as deputy clerk and later as a representative."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0290-88ccccab6be3</data>
    </node>
